<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>116年1月排班表</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 8px 4px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #34495e;
            color: white;
        }
        .rest-day {
            background-color: #e8f8f5;
            color: #16a085;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .work-day {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .note {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 10px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>116年 1月 智慧排班表</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>日期</th>
            <th>星期</th>
            <th>班別/狀態</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td>1/1</td><td>五</td><td class="rest-day">元旦休假</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/2</td><td>六</td><td class="work-day">日B班</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/3</td><td>日</td><td class="rest-day">例假</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/4 - 1/7</td><td>一~四</td><td class="work-day">正常上班 (4天)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/8</td><td>五</td><td class="rest-day">排休 (1)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/9 - 1/12</td><td>六~二</td><td class="work-day">正常上班 (4天)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/13</td><td>三</td><td class="rest-day">排休 (2)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/14 - 1/17</td><td>四~日</td><td class="work-day">正常上班 (4天)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/18</td><td>一</td><td class="rest-day">排休 (3)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/19 - 1/21</td><td>二~四</td><td class="work-day">正常上班 (3天)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/22</td><td>五</td><td class="rest-day">排休 (4)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/23 - 1/26</td><td>六~二</td><td class="work-day">正常上班 (4天)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/27</td><td>三</td><td class="rest-day">排休 (5)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/28 - 1/30</td><td>四~六</td><td class="work-day">正常上班 (3天)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1/31</td><td>日</td><td class="rest-day">例假</td></tr>
    </table>
    
    <div class="note">
        <strong>💡 排班亮點：</strong><br>
        1. 完美落實每月 10 天休假（含元旦與例假）。<br>
        2. 最大連續上班天數不超過 4 天，完全避開 12 天紅線[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span)。<br>
        3. 替 2 月初的農曆過年預留完美的體力與彈性！
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    // LocalStorage 基本存檔功能建議架構
    function saveScheduleState() {
        const scheduleData = { month: "2027-01", updated: new Date().toISOString() };
        localStorage.setItem('my_schedule_2027_01', JSON.stringify(scheduleData));
    }
    // 自動執行存檔紀錄
    saveScheduleState();
</script>

</body>
</html>
